# Spring 6.2 / Spring Boot 3.5 OSS line this project runs. Real fix = Spring Boot 4 migration,
# planned as its own sprint. Decision: .logs/decisions.md, 2026-11-18 [BRAINSTORM] — option B.
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-17

# spring-webmvc CVE-2026-47890 (CRITICAL): SSE stream corruption; same as above — fix only in Spring
